sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Buyer as Buyer
    actor Seller as Seller
    participant MobileMart as MobileMart System (API & DB)
    participant PhysicalWorld as External World (Physical Meetup / Direct Payment)

    Buyer->>Seller: Agree on sale details via MobileMart Messaging
    Seller->>MobileMart: PATCH /api/v1/listings/:id/status { status: "RESERVED", reservedFor: buyerId }
    MobileMart-->>Seller: 200 OK (Listing marked RESERVED; hidden from new search inquiries)

    Note over Buyer, PhysicalWorld: DIRECT EXTERNAL SETTLEMENT (OUTSIDE MOBILEMART)<br/>MobileMart does NOT touch money, verify payments, or hold escrow.
    Buyer->>PhysicalWorld: Physical Meetup / Device Handover
    Buyer->>PhysicalWorld: Inspect device hardware & condition
    Buyer->>Seller: Direct Cash / External Bank Transfer settlement

    Seller->>MobileMart: PATCH /api/v1/listings/:id/status { status: "SOLD" }
    MobileMart->>MobileMart: Verify seller ownership & valid transition (ACTIVE/RESERVED -> SOLD)
    MobileMart->>MobileMart: Atomic update { status: "SOLD", updatedAt: now }
    MobileMart-->>Seller: 200 OK (Listing permanently marked as SOLD)
